1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,200
Welcome to the Animal Sounds Song!

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,000
Can you make the sounds with me?

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:11,700
Let's go! Here we go!

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,000
Here comes the cow!

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,000
The cow says: MOO! MOO!

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,000
Can you say MOO?

7
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,800
MOO! MOO! MOO!

8
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,000
Look! A little yellow duck!

9
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,000
The duck says: QUACK! QUACK!

10
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,000
Can you say QUACK?

11
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,800
QUACK! QUACK! QUACK!

12
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,000
Hello, little orange cat!

13
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:42,000
The cat says: MEOW! MEOW!

14
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:45,000
Can you say MEOW?

15
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,800
MEOW! MEOW! MEOW!

16
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,000
Who is that? It's the dog!

17
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,000
The dog says: WOOF! WOOF!

18
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:57,000
Can you say WOOF?

19
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:59,800
WOOF! WOOF! WOOF!

20
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:03,000
Hop, hop! It's the frog!

21
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:06,000
The frog says: RIBBIT! RIBBIT!

22
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:09,000
Can you say RIBBIT?

23
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:11,800
RIBBIT! RIBBIT! RIBBIT!

24
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:15,000
Meet the big, brave lion!

25
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:18,000
The lion says: ROAR! ROAR!

26
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,000
Can you say ROAR?

27
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,800
ROAR! ROAR! ROAR!

28
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:27,000
Swing, swing! Monkey time!

29
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:30,000
The monkey says: OOH OOH AH AH!

30
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:33,000
Can you say OOH OOH AH AH?

31
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:35,800
OOH OOH AH AH!

32
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:39,000
The big elephant is here!

33
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:42,000
The elephant says: TOOT! TOOT!

34
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:45,000
Can you say TOOT?

35
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,800
TOOT! TOOT! TOOT!

36
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:51,600
Guess who? Who says MOO?

37
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,700
It's the COW! MOO! MOO!

38
00:01:56,300 --> 00:01:59,600
Guess who? Who says QUACK?

39
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,700
It's the DUCK! QUACK! QUACK!

40
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:07,600
Guess who? Who says ROAR?

41
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,700
It's the LION! ROAR! ROAR!

42
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:15,600
Guess who? Who says RIBBIT?

43
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:19,700
It's the FROG! RIBBIT! RIBBIT!

44
00:02:20,300 --> 00:02:23,800
Let's sing with all our friends!

45
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:27,700
Moo, quack, meow, woof!

46
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:31,700
Ribbit, roar, ooh-ooh, toot!

47
00:02:32,100 --> 00:02:35,700
We are the animal friends!

48
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:39,900
You did it! Great job!

49
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:43,900
Thank you for watching!

50
00:02:44,300 --> 00:02:47,700
See you next time! Bye bye!

